{"ts": 1791255628.567018, "type": "step", "step": 19, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Nice \u2014 you\u2019ve got the core concepts now. Here\u2019s the quick check:\n\n- Environment = state, observations, actions, dynamics.\n- POMDP = when the agent can\u2019t directly see the full state, so it has to infer it from observations and may take actions to gather information.\n- pass^k = all k runs succeed, which is stricter than pass@k.\n\nYour build write-up should likely include:\n1) a clear environment definition,\n2) whether it is fully or partially observable,\n3) how success is measured, and\n4) evaluation on at least 3 seeds using pass^k.\n\nNow, try this: tell me in one sentence how a POMDP differs from a normal Markov decision process, and then I\u2019ll help you turn that into build-ready wording.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-environments"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok got it, thanks\n[activity] t=15 messages 2m", "t": 17, "activity": [{"t": 15, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20987799811012606, "pomdp": 0.47321843872481417, "pass_k": 0.20987799811012606}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7600005928827397, "motivation": 0.8945163589496804, "reliance": 0.47672973051941625, "persistence": 0.33045379926157714, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.30772234089151984, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.275207256822714, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791255630.649888, "type": "step", "step": 20, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Let\u2019s keep this moving with a very short, build-focused checklist you can use right away:\n\n1) What is the agent\u2019s state? What can it observe?\n2) What actions can it take?\n3) What are the dynamics / transition rules?\n4) Is it fully observable or a POMDP?\n5) How will you test it on 3 seeds?\n6) For evaluation, use pass^k = all k runs succeed.\n\nReply with a rough 2\u20133 sentence description of your environment, and I\u2019ll help you sharpen it into build wording.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-environments"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: nice, I think I see it now\n[activity] t=17 messages 2m", "t": 19, "activity": [{"t": 17, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20987799811012606, "pomdp": 0.5490935238232851, "pass_k": 0.20987799811012606}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7600005928827397, "motivation": 0.8945163589496804, "reliance": 0.49672973051941627, "persistence": 0.33045379926157714, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.30772234089151984, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.275207256822714, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.533, "seen_posts": []}}
